### LLM Query API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = {{auth_response.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1. Health Check - Check if LLM service is available
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/llm/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Query LLM (Non-Streaming)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/llm/query
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What is this document about?",
  "selectedPdfIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"],
  "workspaceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "chatHistoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "llmModel": "gpt-4o-mini"
}

### 3. Query LLM with Streaming (SSE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/llm/query
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "query": "Summarize the main points from these documents.",
  "selectedPdfIds": [
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"
  ],
  "workspaceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "chatHistoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "llmModel": "gpt-4-turbo"
}

### 4. Query with GPT-4.1 Mini
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/llm/query
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What are the key findings?",
  "selectedPdfIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"],
  "workspaceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "chatHistoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "llmModel": "gpt-4.1-mini"
}

### 5. Query with Local LLaMA-3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/llm/query
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Explain the methodology used.",
  "selectedPdfIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"],
  "workspaceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "chatHistoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "llmModel": "local-llama-3"
}

### 6. Invalid Request - Empty Query
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/llm/query
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "",
  "selectedPdfIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"],
  "workspaceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "chatHistoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "llmModel": "gpt-4o-mini"
}

### 7. Invalid Request - No PDFs Selected
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/llm/query
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What is this about?",
  "selectedPdfIds": [],
  "workspaceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "chatHistoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "llmModel": "gpt-4o-mini"
}

### 8. Invalid Request - Missing LLM Model
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/llm/query
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What is this about?",
  "selectedPdfIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"],
  "workspaceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "chatHistoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "llmModel": ""
}
